15
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:59.000
which Richard took far more seriously than most people. One day in September 2012, Richard took a seat at the counter of the Student Union Bar, Bar Latitude. At age 25, he was slightly older than his fellow students, many of whom had come to think his manner was somewhat odd. He was considered a loner who spent a lot of time with books on his computer or in his own little world. Bar Latitude was a typical student drinking hole, hosting events such as open mic nights, comedy and student society fundraisers. He'd had colourful, eclectic decor with games and pool tables for entertainment.

