and Ella was mildly surprised to receive a hug from the man she barely knew. She accepted Richard's friend request on Facebook, which wasn't unusual for her regular customers and fellow students. He gave her a kiss on the cheek when he left that day, overjoyed that their relationship had taken a new step. Richard had already found Ella's Twitter feed. She was a prolific Twitter, and Richard read through them all. There were some in particular he thought were meant for him specifically. Just hold me baby, and we'll be alright. You know he's the one when your heart beats a bit faster. He walked into my life and it's beautiful. He believed she was letting him know how she felt

