00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:57.000
He had brought along entry forms that needed to be filled out by individual team members, which he shoved at her. She took them and promised to fill them out as soon as she had time. Richard told her she needed to supply a photograph with the application, and she told him to go ahead and choose one for her since she was busy. That evening, Richard scrolled through her Facebook photos looking for the perfect picture to submit to the TV show. Happy to have an excuse to private message her, he started a chat. Maybe this one, he asked. Ella couldn't see the photo Richard was referring to. What photo is it? She replied. You're wearing a low-cut black lace trimmed top.

