00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:41.000
On your pink lips, a mischievous smile is playing. Ella replied, if you think I look smart enough. Richard then teased that she had not posted any photos of herself in the glasses she sometimes wore. He knew there were no photos on Facebook with her wearing them, because he had looked at every single one. When not on the bar whilst Ella was working, Richard spent the remainder of his time honing his general knowledge. Determined to impress Ella and get the team on TV, he revised intensively. During breaks in his revision, he would go through Ella's Facebook,

