00:18:17.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Richard's behaviour grew increasingly erratic over the following weeks. He picked fights with his friends, doing petty things like snatching away his scrabble board in the middle of a game. He was still gambling and his drinking became troublesome, often sculling down two bottles of wine and then heading out to a club. If the bouncers wouldn't let him in, he would climb the fence and start fights. He no longer had access to Ella's Facebook, but there was still her Twitter and Instagram. The bubbly, outgoing Ella was prolific on social media and Richard scrolled through her timelines, photos and stories. Doing this, he came across a tweet she once posted that said, when I say I'm done, I mean fight for me. Richard believed

