the tweet was meant for him and was prepared to accept her challenge. Richard made sure to bear the bar for every single one of Ella's shifts. He stayed for the duration, just sitting and staring. In his mind, she was Princess Leia, to his Han Solo. The fantasy was so strong, he could hear the music of Star Wars running through his head. Eventually, Ella swapped jobs with colleagues so that she could work in the kitchen. Away from Richard's unwavering gaze. Ella did what she could to avoid him, but she could never shake the feeling he was always around, watching. One day in December, Richard stopped her and tried to speak to her.

