00:54:50.000 --> 00:55:45.000
have happened and I would not have been subjected to as long an ordeal. Ella was no longer the bubbly, friendly barmaid ready with a smile and a chat. The three years of living in fear took their toll and she became reclusive. Richard Britton was released after serving just 15 months of his sentence. In early 2017, he was posting online again on a blog he called Putting New Wine in New Bottles. He recounted some of his experiences in prison, including watching the entire series of Dexter and befriending rapist George Cameron. Richard Britton's books remain available for sale, including his deluded fantasy opus to his victim and princess Ella Tundra. Audio of Richard Britton reading the introduction of The World Rose is still online.

